<body>
    <h1>Conversion of existing Alerts data to new datamodel</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>This conversion project is used to convert Alerts existing data,=
 from the current data model to suit to the new data model. </p>
<p>As part of this conversion, take a backup of Alerts tables which are goi=
ng to be modified as part of conversion. After taking backup, run update on=
 database, which will update/generate required data for the new data model.=
</p>
<p>Below are the commands to generate backup and update,</p>
<p>1) Command for backup of existing data,</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;"><strong>java -Doperation=3Dbackup -jar db=
p-alertsbackupupdate.jar</strong></p>
<p>backup scripts will be generated in <strong>AlertsDatabaseScripts </stro=
ng>folder in system=E2=80=99s temp folder.</p>
<p>Below are the tables will be backed up,</p>
<ul>
<li><p>dbxalertcategory</p></li>
<li><p>dbxalerttype</p></li>
<li><p>alertsubtype</p></li>
<li><p>dbxcustomeralertentitlement</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p>2) Command to update to new data model,</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;"><strong>java -Doperation=3Dupdate -jar db=
p-alertsbackupupdate.jar</strong></p>
<p>Below are the tables will be updated, by taking the data from existing t=
ables, converting it to suit to the new tables, so that all the existing cu=
stomers' subscriptions would remain and get converted accordingly.</p>
<ul>
<li><p>dbxalerttype</p></li>
<li><p>alertsubtype</p></li>
<li><p>customeralertchannel</p></li>
<li><p>dbxcustomeralertentitlement</p></li>
<li><p>alertsubtypeapp</p></li>
<li><p>alertsubtypeaccounttype</p></li>
<li><p>alertsubtypecustomertype</p></li>
<li><p>alerttypechannel</p></li>
<li><p>alertsubtypechannel</p></li>
</ul>
<p>The above functionality is available as project AlertsBackupUpdate in th=
e repository.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
